New: DataComponentInterpretation::component_is_ignored allows DataOut and
related classes to omit selected components of a data vector. Each call to
add_data_vector() can select a different subset of components, even when the
vectors share a DoFHandler, for example to output two velocities and a pressure
from three different vectors in the same mixed finite element space.
<br>
